<title>USA: U.S. coffee roastings lower in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. coffee roastings lower in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Complete Coffee Coverage reported U.S. green coffee roastings as follows:</p>
<p>For the week ended Jan 18, roastings totaled about 385,000 60-kg bags, down from 420,000 bags the previous week but up from 375,000 bags in the corresponding week a year ago.</p>
<p>Cumilative roastings totaled 1,135,000 60-kg bags versus 1,150,000 bags in the same year-ago period.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
